{
 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "The Leguminous affair is extremely curious, I am quite gone over to your side in the matter of eternal hybrids & hermaph. ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Carmichælia & Clianthus",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": " have closed flowers, & hence probably require artificial hybridization but ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Edwardsia",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": " has exserted genitalia. & should not be parallel case",
     "label": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "With regard to the ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Wellington Clover",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": " case, it really looks too good— my impression is that ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Wellington",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": " was hardly a colony before ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "1842",
     "label": "date"
    },
    {
     "text": ", & that there could not be sufficient clover cultivation there before that to warrant any conclusions, but I may be wrong— At any rate I should like some definite details of the state & extent of ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Clover",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": "-crops before ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "1842",
     "label": "date"
    },
    {
     "text": ", say in 1839–40— I will show your letter to ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Sinclair",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": ", who will be here ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "tomorrow",
     "label": "date"
    },
    {
     "text": ".",
     "label": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "None of ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "the New Zealand Legumes",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": " have flowers quite as small as ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Clover",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": ", though those of ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Carmichælia & of Notospartium",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": " are very small. Is it not dangerous to assume that ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Humble",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": " bees would not visit small flowers in ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "New Zealand",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": ", because they do not in ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "England",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": "— In ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "England",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": " I fancy the more numerous & active ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "hive-bee",
     "label": "person"
    },
    {
     "text": " forestalls ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "the Humble bee",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": " in the matter of small flowers—if indeed the ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Humble",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": " bees do not visit the latter— They surely visit Heather-flowers in ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Scotland",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": "?",
     "label": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "It would indeed be curious if a relation could be traced between no bees & no small fld. Leguminosæ—but you must remember the strange absence of small ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Leguminosæ",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": " in ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Fuegia",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": ", ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Falklands, & the Pacific Islands",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": " generally. The question hence becomes a very involved one, & forms part of a larger one, viz is there any relation between the Geog. ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "distrib",
     "label": "person"
    },
    {
     "text": ". of ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "bees & of",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": " ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Leguminosæ",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": ".",
     "label": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "Bentham",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": "’s late researches into the ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "British",
     "label": "person"
    },
    {
     "text": " ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Flora",
     "label": "person"
    },
    {
     "text": " have so greatly modified his views of the limits of species, that in my eyes they invalidate the results of local ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Floras",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": " very materially. He has completed the MS. of his ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "British",
     "label": "person"
    },
    {
     "text": " ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Flora",
     "label": "person"
    },
    {
     "text": ", having studied every species from all parts of the world, and most of them alive in ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Britain",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": ", ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "France",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": ", and other parts of ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Europe",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": ". Well—he has turned out as great a lumper as I am! and worse.",
     "label": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "Then did you see a paper of ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Decaisne",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": "’s on ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Pyrus",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": ", translated in Gard. ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Chron",
     "label": "person"
    },
    {
     "text": ". ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "about 3 weeks ago",
     "label": "date"
    },
    {
     "text": "—in which he adopts ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Thomson’s",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": " and my views of species and says that if he had to monograph ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Plantaginaceae",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": " again he would reduce whole sections to one species and of course as many species, i.e. marked forms, would then rank as varieties. Now it was ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Decaisne",
     "label": "person"
    },
    {
     "text": " (a most admirable ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Botanist",
     "label": "person"
    },
    {
     "text": ") who on receiving ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "the Flora Indica",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": ", wrote me most kindly and earnestly begging me to reconsider my mode of viewing species, and hinting that I was going to the devil. All this does not directly affect your results, but it shows that you should draw them from materials of all kinds—local and general, and from systematists.",
     "label": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "〈section missing〉 forms & should never have dreamed of establishing two varieties on the 20 specimens, but simply regarded the plant as variable.",
     "label": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "Are you coming up ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "next week",
     "label": "date"
    },
    {
     "text": "— we hope the ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Sulivans",
     "label": "person"
    },
    {
     "text": " are coming to take a quiet pot-luck with us on ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Tuesday",
     "label": "date"
    },
    {
     "text": " at 6 when ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Sinclair",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": " will be here & Lindley— Can you not come if to be in ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "Town",
     "label": "place"
    },
    {
     "text": "?",
     "label": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "Henslow",
     "label": "org"
    },
    {
     "text": " will be here on ",
     "label": null
    },
    {
     "text": "the following week",
     "label": "date"
    },
    {
     "text": ".",
     "label": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "segments": [
    {
     "text": "E〈ver yrs〉 affly",
     "label": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}